  + permit a later response admission without pretending terminal state is READY or re-executing the procedure

& [Work]
  + preserved the slice activation source and passed it through SJS review and a hash-bound phase lock before implementation
  + implemented strict pending report and wrapper forms finite scripted terminal runner whole-wrapper validator and one-response admission helper
  + reused exact provider-prefix replay and final-registry INSPECT plus READ verification
