  + tested finite script bounds closed JSON provider claim request usage projection registry malformed output and private-field handling

& [Observation]
  + TERMINAL is a procedure state while COMPLETE is an orchestration claim made only after a separate reflection response is admitted
  + the pending artifact is a stable re-entry frame for reflection but not an ADVANCE reentry handle
  + pausing at this seam makes model pass boundaries inspectable without hidden-state access

